/* index242 — REMOVED: aaGetTarget, assetLibraryAudit, assetRateCardValue, assetTaskProgress, autoConsolidateSameSponsorDupes, folderTagCount, getContractFile, getRate, jumpToInventoryFolder, notifyServiceTeamForAgreement, optionSummaryText, parseStatus, ratedCountInCategory, renderAssetLibrary, resetAssetSpecs, squadStatusColor, stageAnyDone, upperTierOpenInventory, utgEmptyCellHtml. Nineteen functions with exactly one reference in the
   whole file: their own definition. Each has a same-purpose sibling that IS used
   (lookupRate for getRate, parseTotal for parseStatus, notifyServiceTeamForRequest for
   notifyServiceTeamForAgreement, renderInventoryAvailability for renderAssetLibrary),
   so these are refactor leftovers rather than lost features. Two are worth rebuilding
   deliberately if they are wanted — resetAssetSpecs (there is no way back to the
   default asset spec text once it has been edited) and assetLibraryAudit (finds
   duplicate catalog entries, unpriced assets and orphaned rate-card rows). Neither had
   a UI to attach to, and inventing one was out of scope for a bug-fix build. */
