// other cached data can be right at that ceiling. When the localStorage write below
// fails, the OLD behavior re-read the same (now stale/incomplete) localStorage value
// on every render, so a perfectly good network pull got silently discarded and photos
// would appear to "load, then vanish" — worse, right after a storage reset there's
